WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 8f7393dfe843d0e2ba5227cef441168a

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.860
Sawa, karibu tena. Sasa umeshatumia kauli za masharti

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.920
kukagua masharti na kuendesha msimbo pale tu

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.800
jambo linapokuwa kweli. Sasa hebu tumtambulishe

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:13.500
mwenza wa if, yaani else. Kwa kauli

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.100
ya masharti, Jiki anaendesha kizuizi cha msimbo pale

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:19.310
sharti linapokuwa kweli, na anaruka kizuizi

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.210
hicho cha msimbo pale linapokuwa sikweli. Lakini vipi

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.060
ikiwa unataka Jiki afanye jambo moja

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.740
sharti linapokuwa kweli, na jambo

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.300
lingine linapokuwa sikweli? Hapo ndipo else

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.180
inapokuja. Tunaweza kuweka kifungu cha else baada ya

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.440
mabano ya kufunga ya if, na Jiki

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.230
ataendesha kifungu hicho ikiwa sharti la if ni sikweli.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:42.370
Kwa hiyo, tukirudi kwenye mfano wa mlinzi wa mlango wa klabu,

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.840
sasa tuna chaguo la kufungua

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:48.670
mlango au la kumkatalia mtu, jambo ambalo

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:51.440
pengine ni bora kuliko kumpuuza kabisa kama

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:54.560
tulivyokuwa tunafanya awali. Fikiria kama

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:56.780
njia panda. Jiki anafika kwenye njia panda hii,

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.820
anakagua sharti, kisha anaweza

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:01.020
kuchukua njia moja ikiwa ni kweli, au

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.000
njia nyingine ikiwa ni sikweli.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:07.050
Lakini hachukui njia zote mbili. Lakini vipi

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.730
kama una uwezekano zaidi ya miwili? Fikiria

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:14.340
mlinzi wetu wa mlango anauza tikiti. Ukiwa chini ya miaka kumi na tatu,

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:17.460
unapata tikiti ya mtoto. Ukiwa kati ya miaka kumi na tatu na ishirini,

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:19.820
unapata tikiti ya kijana. Ukiwa na miaka ishirini au zaidi,

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:21.920
ni tikiti ya mtu mzima. Kwa hiyo sasa una matokeo

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.700
matatu tofauti. Kwa hili, tunaweza kuongeza kauli

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:28.640
nyingine ya masharti baada ya else. Kwa hiyo tunaweza

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:32.420
kusema, "Kama hivi, basi fanya hivi. La sivyo kama

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:36.160
hivi, fanya hivi. La sivyo, fanya kitu kingine."

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.120
Kwa hiyo katika mfano huu, Jiki ataona

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:43.120
if na kuangalia sharti la kwanza. Je, kumi na sita

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:47.380
ni ndogo kuliko kumi na tatu? Hapana. Kwa hiyo anaendelea

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:51.000
hadi kwenye else if. Je, kumi na sita ni ndogo kuliko

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:55.800
ishirini? Ndiyo, hilo ni kweli. Kwa hiyo anaendesha

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:58.960
kizuizi hicho na kutoa tikiti ya kijana. Lakini

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.340
hapo amemaliza. Haangalii kitu kingine chochote.

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.000
Hata haangalii hicho else cha mwisho.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:08.600
Mara Jiki anapopata sharti ambalo ni kweli,

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:11.480
anaendesha kizuizi hicho, na anaruka kila kitu

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:14.980
kingine kilicho chini yake. Hili ndilo jambo la muhimu

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.380
kuelewa. Kizuizi kimoja tu ndicho kinaendeshwa. Jiki

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.980
anashuka kwenye mnyororo huu, anapata sharti la kwanza

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:24.400
la kweli, anaendesha kizuizi hicho, na anaendelea. Sasa,

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:25.980
kuna jambo moja unalopaswa

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:29.020
kuelewa vizuri kwa sababu hili huwachanganya watu wengi. Kuna

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:33.800
tofauti ndogo lakini muhimu sana kati ya kuandika kauli mbili

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:39.120
tofauti za masharti na kutumia else if. Kwa hiyo

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.390
fikiria tunaunda programu inayotoa

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:44.989
zawadi ya kawaida au zawadi ya ziada

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:48.660
kulingana na alama za mtu. Angalia uwezekano huu miwili.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:53.360
Mmoja unatumia else na mwingine... samahani.

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:55.800
Mmoja unatumia else if na mwingine unatumia

00:02:55.880 --> 00:03:00.240
kauli mbili tofauti za if. Nini kitatokea tofauti? Chukua

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.140
muda kidogo kufikiria hili. Labda usimamishe

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:06.570
video. Kwa hiyo katika kisa cha kwanza, chenye

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:10.340
else if, tunaangalia kama alama ni kubwa

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:12.860
na kutoa zawadi ya ziada, na kisha

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.720
hatuendeshi hicho else if. Kwa hiyo mtu huyo, kama

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:18.120
ana alama zaidi ya mia moja,

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:21.850
anapata zawadi ya ziada pekee. Lakini katika mfano

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:25.840
wa pili, if hizo mbili zinajitegemea kabisa. Zote

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:29.860
mbili zitaendeshwa na zote mbili zitakuwa kweli. Kwa hiyo

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:33.280
mtu hapa anapata zawadi mbili. Katika

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:35.700
wa kwanza, zawadi moja. Katika wa pili,

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:38.380
zawadi mbili. Chukua muda kidogo

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:42.990
kuhakikisha umeelewa hilo vizuri. Pia, inafurahisha

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.850
kutambua kwamba yote mawili yanaweza kuwa sahihi

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.060
kulingana na jinsi mchezo ulivyoundwa. Labda

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:50.600
mshiriki anapata zawadi ya kawaida na

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:54.160
ya ziada, au labda anapewa

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.780
zawadi ya ziada tu badala ya ile ya kawaida. Hakuna msimbo

00:03:56.820 --> 00:04:00.060
ulio sahihi au mbaya kati ya hii miwili. Inafaa tu katika hali

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:03.620
tofauti. Lakini unahitaji kujua

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.560
ni upi unakusudia

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:08.960
kutumia. Kwa hiyo katika mazoezi yanayofuata,

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.320
utatumia if, else if na else

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:14.340
kushughulikia hali tofauti. Kila la heri. Tutaonana

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:15.040
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
